 "comment": "Camera v1.7.1 FIELD-FAILURE HOTFIX acceptance (Eyes, real-scene lane). Fallback coordinates are grounded in the FIXED layout (spacer bug fixed: bottomWrap is wrap-content at the bottom; shutter center ~(0.45, 0.91), mode bar y~0.83, gear ~(0.79, 0.09)) \u2014 NOT the broken v1.6.0/v1.7.0 geometry (shutter was y~0.57, mode bar y~0.135). tap_element grounds from the hierarchy first; fallbacks fire only if grounding fails. The Back-walk (steps 13-18) is the Standard Part 3B evidence: Settings -> viewfinder, MORE -> viewfinder, Back on the viewfinder STAYS (status line shows the STAY line). The final Back is LAST so an exit, if it happens, is caught by observe 10-after-back-video and the harness pid-alive check instead of destroying earlier evidence. Do NOT mark the Settings tap optional \u2014 if Settings cannot be opened, the run must fail loudly.",
 "density": 420,
 "height": 2280,
 "image": "google_apis",
 "package": "com.onioncore.camera",
 "permissions": [
  "CAMERA",
  "RECORD_AUDIO"
 ],
 "steps": [
  {
   "do": "record_start"
  },
  {
   "do": "screenshot",
   "label": "00-opening"
  },
  {
   "do": "wait",
   "seconds": 5
  },
  {
   "do": "observe",
   "label": "01-viewfinder"
  },
  {
   "do": "wait",
   "seconds": 8
  },
  {
   "do": "screenshot",
   "label": "02-viewfinder-later"
  },
  {
   "do": "tap_element",
   "fallback_xy": [
    0.45,
    0.91
   ],
   "match": "exact",
   "text": "Shutter"
  },
  {
   "do": "wait",
   "seconds": 3
  },
  {
   "do": "assert_text",
   "soft": true,
   "text": "Saved"
  },
  {
   "do": "screenshot",
   "label": "03-after-shutter"
  },
  {
   "cmd": "newest=$(adb shell ls -t /sdcard/Pictures/OnionCamera/ 2>/dev/null | head -1 | tr -d '\\015'); if [ -n \"$newest\" ]; then adb pull \"/sdcard/Pictures/OnionCamera/$newest\" \"$RESULTS/taken-photo.jpg\" && api_put \"eyes $ID: taken photo\" \"cloud-pc/storage/eyes/results/$ID/taken-photo.jpg\"; fi",
   "do": "shell"
  },
  {
   "cmd": "if [ -n \"$newest\" ]; then adb shell am start -a android.intent.action.VIEW -d \"file:///sdcard/Pictures/OnionCamera/$newest\" -t \"image/jpeg\" >/dev/null 2>&1; fi",
   "do": "shell"
  },
  {
   "do": "wait",
   "seconds": 3
  },
  {
   "do": "screenshot",
   "label": "04-stock-gallery"
  },
  {
   "do": "tap_element",
   "fallback_xy": [
    0.79,
    0.09
   ],
   "text": "Settings"
  },
  {
   "do": "wait",
   "seconds": 1
  },
  {
   "do": "observe",
   "label": "05-settings"
  },
  {
   "do": "back"
  },
  {
   "do": "wait",
   "seconds": 1
  },
  {
   "do": "observe",
   "label": "06-after-back-settings"
  },
  {
   "do": "tap_element",
   "fallback_xy": [
    0.79,
    0.83
   ],
   "text": "MORE"
  },
  {
   "do": "wait",
   "seconds": 1
  },
  {
   "do": "observe",
   "label": "07-more-grid"
  },
  {
   "do": "back"
  },
  {
   "do": "wait",
   "seconds": 1
  },
  {
   "do": "observe",
   "label": "08-after-back-more"
  },
  {
   "do": "tap_element",
   "fallback_xy": [
    0.42,
    0.83
   ],
   "text": "VIDEO"
  },
  {
   "do": "wait",
   "seconds": 1
  },
  {
   "do": "observe",
   "label": "09-video-mode"
  },
  {
   "do": "back"
  },
  {
   "do": "wait",
   "seconds": 1
  },
  {
   "do": "assert_text",
   "soft": true,
   "text": "Back stays here"
  },
  {
   "do": "observe",
   "label": "10-after-back-video"
  },
  {
   "do": "record_stop",
   "label": "flow"
  }
 ],
